00:05:16,666 --> 00:05:22,666
Kiss and Cry is a romance, drama, music film directed by Sean Cisterna.

2
00:10:33,333 --> 00:10:39,333
A romantic drama based on the story of Carley Allison, a promising 18 year old figure skater and singer
who made medical history in her fight against a rare 1 in 3.5 billion type of sarcoma.

3
