Carley Allison, played by Sarah Fisher.

4
00:21:06,666 --> 00:21:12,666
John Servinis, played by Luke Bilyk.

5
00:26:23,333 --> 00:26:29,333
May Allison, played by Chantal Kreviazuk.

6
