9
00:47:30,000 --> 00:47:36,000
Kiss and Cry is a 2017 Canadian biopic directed by Sean Cisterna.

10
00:52:46,666 --> 00:52:52,666
The film depicts the life of Carley Allison who
suffered from a rare form of cancer.

11
00:58:03,333 --> 00:58:09,333
It was filmed at various real locations, such as Carley’s house and
bedroom, skating rink, classrooms and hospitals in Toronto.

12
01:03:20,000 --> 01:03:26,000
The film stars Carley’s real-life friend Sarah Fisher.

13
01:08:36,666 --> 01:08:42,666
Throughout the film, Fisher breaks the fourth wall, using the very words
from the real Allison’s blog posts and You Tube performances.

14
01:13:53,333 --> 01:13:59,333
The letter Carley writes and addresses to “cancer”
is also partly her actual words.

15
01:19:10,000 --> 01:19:16,000
It was released on February 10, 2017 and has been rated as a 6.8 out of 10.

16
01:24:26,666 --> 01:24:32,666
The film explores themes of cancer, figure
skating, teenage girl, woman director.

17
01:29:43,333 --> 01:29:49,333
The tone is emotional.
